C ELM38D              LOGICAL VARIABLES RELATED TO PLOTTING
C
C DOENT      TRUE IF THE ENTRANCE FACE OF THE MAGNET IS TO BE SHOWN
C DOEXIT     TRUE IF THE EXIT FACE OF THE MAGNET IS TO BE SHOWN                     
C DOTOP      TRUE OF THE TOP OF THE MAGNET IS TO BE SHOWN
C DOSIDE     TRUE IF THE SIDE OF THE MAGNET IS TO BE SHOWN
C REVERS     TRUE IF THE MAGNET IS ROLLED SUFFICIENTLY FAR SO THAT
C                    THE BOTTOM AND/OR BACK SIDE ARE SHOWN
C ROLD       TRUE IF THE MAGNET IS ROLLED AT ALL
C CWISE      TRUE IF THE ROLL OF THE MAGNET IS CLOCKWISE
C
      LOGICAL         DOENT, DOEXIT, DOTOP, DOSIDE, REVERS, ROLD, CWISE
C
      COMMON /ELM38D/ DOENT, DOEXIT, DOTOP, DOSIDE, REVERS, ROLD, CWISE
